ated yes unfortunately in both cases  oh  absolutely but the same thing to be  treated the same way  no so the way at which it seems to have  been concluded that  john barrowman needs to be punished  again  feels really weird to me and i'm not  saying he does not deserve  some form of punishment i'm not even  necessarily going to say that these  cancellations are bad ideas  and i will also add that from the  perspective of the bbc  and or big finish it's just a pr move  like i said none of this information is  new to them  but suddenly it's bad pr so let's just  let's nix that for right now and maybe  if it ever quiets down it'll come back  but from their perspective that's all  this is this this is only a pr move  but from within the fandom and seeing  the fights go on  we were okay with it  and if we're going to say that he was  wrong  then we have to own up and say that we  were wrong  and i'll include myself in that when i  went and saw him at  terrificon he told a story on stage at  his  panel performance thing i don't know  what to call it it was fun  but he told a story about holding a kiss  with  i believe it was james marsters  for longer than was originally planned  he asked the director not to call cut so  that he could make it last longer  and i laughed and i need to own up to  that  because that behavior isn't appropriate  that's extended physical  intimate contact beyond the parameters  of  what should have gone on for that shoot  for that scene for their professional  job  strictly for the purposes of john  berman's entertainment  and he would probably claim hopefully  for the entertainment of others  but it was inappropriate  i laughed i didn't think more about it  and i need to come to terms with that  collectively all of us  need to come to terms with our own  culpability and complicity  in his behavior and his belief that it  was okay  because if every time he performed these  acts on set  if the majority of people laughed and  maybe he failed to realize it was  nervous laughter  i don't know it wasn't there and if  every time he retells these stories in  front of an audience  he gets applause and laughter validation  then we helped perpetuate the behavior  to some degree  and i need to see more of us having  that conversation with ourselves and  each other  if we're also going to hold him  responsible  now are we responsible for his behavior  no  no we're not but there was absolutely a  culture that validated and reinforced  and  applauded literally applauded  what it was he did and we need to  take our own ownership of that do i  think it's  the right thing to do to cut berryman  out of  the doctor who property and just  not have him appear any further  i don't know i don't feel comfortable  saying it's  the wrong thing or the right thing all i  can say  is it makes me  feel weird watching it happen  knowing how public this information was  i don't have a definitive conclusion i  don't know what the best thing  to do is in terms of his involvement  moving forward i honestly  do not know and maybe this is the best  thing  i don't have a conclusion yet  but i am asking myself questions  that i hope more people  will start to also ask of themselves  because this doesn't happen in a vacuum  especially not  in a case like berman where  we all knew so those are my  ultimately inconclusive thoughts but i i  really had to again just expel from my  head  this stuff because it it needles me  and if i don't get it out it's gonna  keep bugging me  but what are your thoughts on all this  whatever your thoughts are  please be as polite as possible about me  about john bearman that's not me saying  you have to approve of him  but please restrain from name calling  and personal attacks  i don't like having that in my comments  no matter what side of the argument  you're on  but if you can keep it respectful  whatever your thoughts are drop  something down in the comments  let's talk about it i have a patreon  which is how i pay my bills and it's how  i keep this operation up and running  there are rewards for every tier from  getting to see the docket early and vote  on potential topics  to access to a discord server your name  in the credits and  more than that there's also the option  for youtube memberships which  nets you some different rewards in some  cases but you don't have to  do any of that the likes share subscribe  those things help me out  i've been doing a little bit better the  algorithm has been totally bearing me  lately so  that every little bit helps it really  does but even that  i am not going to insist that you do it  because at the end of the day you're the  council  i just run the meetings and until next  time this council  is adjourned  [Music]  [Applause]  [Music]  bye
 

